{"r":"Tlb","lane":{"p":1864,"e":[{"h":"طَلَبَهُ","t":["(S, A, O, &c.,) aor. , (Msb,) inf. n. ",[2,"طَلَبٌ"]," (S, A, MA, O, Msb, K &c.) and ",[2,"مَطْلَبٌ"]," (A, MA, Msb) and ",[2,"طِلَابٌ"]," and ",[2,"طِلَابَةٌ"]," (A, MA) and ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"]," (MA) and ",[2,"تَطْلَابٌ"]," [which is of a measure denoting intensiveness]; (TA;) and ↓ ",[2,"اِطَّلَبَهُ"],"; (S, A, O, Msb, K;) and ↓ ",[2,"تطلّبهُ"],"; (A, K;) [but see this last below;] ",[1,"He sought it, desired it, demanded it,"]," or ",[1,"asked for it;"]," (MA;) [",[1,"he pursued it, pursued after it,"]," or ",[1,"prosecuted it;"],"] ",[1,"he sought, desired,"]," or ",[1,"endeavoured, to find it and to get"]," or ",[1,"take it:"]," (A, K, TA:) ",[1,"and"],[2,"طَلَبَ"]," is also expl. as signifying ",[2,"اتبع"]," [i. e. ",[2,"أَتْبَعَ"],[1,"he followed in pursuit,"]," &c.]. (TA.) One says, ",[2,"اُطْلُبْ لِى شَيْئًا"],[1,"Seek thou,"]," &c., ",[1,"for me, a thing."]," (Lh, TA.) And ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ مِنْهُ"]," and ",[2,"إِلَيْهِ"],", inf. n. as above, ",[1,"He sought it, desired it, demanded it,"]," or ",[1,"asked for it, of him."]," (MA.) And ",[2,"طَلَبَ إِلَىَّ"]," means ",[2,"رَغِبَ"]," [i. e. ",[1,"He petitioned me,"]," or ",[1,"made petition to me,"]," &c.]: (K, TA:) or ",[2,"طَلَبَ إِلَيْهِ"]," means ",[2,"سَأَلَهُ"]," [",[1,"he asked him"],"]: or [it means] ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ رَاغِبًا إِلَيْهِ"]," [",[1,"he sought him, petitioning him"],"]; for it is generally held that ",[2,"طَلَبَ"]," is not trans. by means of a prep., therefore they explain the like of this phrase as implicative. (MF, TA.) See also 4, in two places: and see 5. You say also, ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ بِحَقٍّ"],", meaning ",[2,"طَالَبَهُ"],", q. v. (K.) And ",[2,"طَلَبَ بِثَأْرِهِ"]," and ",[2,"بِذَحْلِهِ"]," [",[1,"He sought to obtain his blood-revenge,"]," or ",[1,"retaliation;"]," and in like manner, ",[2,"طَلَبَ بِدَمِهِ"],"]. (S and Msb in art. ",[2,"ذحل"],".) ― -b2- [Hence,] one says also, ",[2,"السِّرَاجُ يَطْلُبُ"],[2,"أَنْ يَنْطَفِئَ"]," (tropical:) [",[1,"The lamp,"]," or ",[1,"lighted wick, is near,"]," or ",[1,"about, to become extinguished"],"]; like as one says, ",[2,"جِدَارٌ يُرِيدُ أَنْ يَنْقَضَّ"],". (A.) -A2- ",[2,"طَلِبَ"],", aor. , (O, K,) inf. n. ",[2,"طَلَبٌ"],", (TK,) ",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it,"]," [accord. to the TK said of a man,] ",[1,"was,"]," or ",[1,"became, distant,"]," or ",[1,"remote."]," (O, K. [See also 4.])"],"f":"1"},{"h":"طَلَّبَ","t":["see 5."],"f":"2"},{"h":"طالبهُ","t":["inf. n. ",[2,"مُطَالَبَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"طِلَابٌ"],", (Msb, K,) ",[1,"He sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of him a thing"]," [",[1,"as being due to him;"]," i. e. ",[1,"he sued"]," or ",[1,"prosecuted him for it"],"]; (Msb;) ",[1,"i. q."],[2,"بِحَقٍّ"]," ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ"]," [",[1,"he sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of him,"]," &c., ",[1,"a right,"]," or ",[1,"due"],"]: (K:) and you say, ",[2,"طالبهُ بِحَقٍّ لَهُ عَلَيْهِ"]," [",[1,"he sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of him,"]," &c., ",[1,"a thing due to him on his part"],"]. (A.) ",[2,"مُطَالَبَةٌ"]," is used in relation to a real thing: [but it does not necessarily imply the justice of the act:] one says, ",[2,"طالب زَيْدٌ عَمْرًا"],[2,"بِالدَّرَاهِمِ"]," [",[1,"Zeyd sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of 'Amr,"]," or ",[1,"sued"]," or ",[1,"prosecuted him for, the money"],"]. (Kull p. 349.) And ",[2,"طالبهُ بِالدَّيْنِ"],[1,"He sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of him"]," [&c.] ",[1,"the debt."]," (MA.) And ",[2,"طالبهُ بِكَذَا"],", (S, O,) inf. n. ",[2,"مُطَالَبَةٌ"],", (S,) [",[1,"He sought"]," or ",[1,"demanded of him,"]," &c., ",[1,"such a thing;"]," or ",[1,"he prosecuted him for such a thing,"]," as, for instance, blood, or mutilation, or a wound: see exs. voce ",[2,"خَبْلٌ"],".]"],"f":"3"},{"h":"اطلبهُ","t":[[1,"He performed,"]," or ",[1,"accomplished, for him,"]," (S, A, O, Msb, TA,) ",[1,"that which he sought,"]," or ",[1,"demanded,"]," (S, A, * O, Msb,) or ",[1,"the object of his want:"]," (TA:) or ",[1,"he gave him that which he sought,"]," or ",[1,"demanded."]," (K.) A man said to the Prophet, ",[2,"إِلَىَّ طَلِبَةً فَإِنِّى أُحِبُّ أَنْ أُطْلِبَكَهَا"]," ↓ ",[2,"اُطْلُبْ"]," i. e. [",[1,"Ask thou of me"],"] ",[1,"an object of want,"]," [",[1,"for I love"],"] ",[1,"to perform it,"]," or ",[1,"accomplish it, for thee."]," (TA.) And one says, ",[2,"إِلَىَّ فَأَطْلَبْتُهُ"]," ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبَ"]," i. e. [",[1,"He asked of me"]," a thing] ",[1,"and I performed,"]," or ",[1,"accomplished, for him that which he sought,"]," or ",[1,"demanded."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"اطلبهُ الشَّىْءَ"],[1,"He aided him,"]," or ",[1,"helped him, to seek the thing."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"أَطْلِبْنِى"],[1,"Aid thou me to seek."]," (Lh, TA.) ― -b2- Also ",[1,"He,"]," or ",[1,"it,"]," (said of a man, Msb, and of poverty, A,) ",[1,"necessitated his seeking,"]," or ",[1,"demanding."]," (S, A, O, Msb, K.) Thus it has two contr. significations. (S, O, K.) ― -b3- And hence, (S, O,) ",[2,"أَطْلَبَ"]," said of water, and of pasture, or herbage, (S, A, O,) &c., (S, O,) ",[1,"It was distant,"]," or ",[1,"remote,"]," (S, A, O,) ",[1,"so as to be not attainable but by seeking,"]," (S, O,) or ",[1,"so that it was sought."]," (A.)"],"f":"4"},{"h":"تطلّبهُ","t":[[1,"He sought it,"]," or ",[1,"demanded it, repeatedly,"]," or ",[1,"time after time:"]," (S, O:) [",[1,"he made repeated,"]," or ",[1,"successive, endeavours to obtain it,"]," or ",[1,"to attain it: he prosecuted a search after it:"],"] or ",[1,"he sought it diligently, studiously, sedulously,"]," or ",[1,"earnestly;"]," syn. ",[2,"اِبْتَغَاهُ"],": (Msb:) or ",[1,"he sought, desired,"]," or ",[1,"endeavoured, leisurely, to find it and to get"]," or ",[1,"take it;"]," (O, TA;) and (TA) so ↓ ",[2,"طلّبهُ"],", inf. n. ",[2,"تَطْلِيبٌ"],"; (K, TA;) and ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ"],"; (TA;) ",[1,"from"]," [",[1,"various"],"] ",[1,"places."]," (O, TA.) ― -b2- See also 1, first sentence."],"f":"5"},{"h":"انطلب لَهُ","t":["is quasi-pass. of ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ"],", and means ",[1,"It"]," (an action [&c.]) ",[1,"was,"]," or ",[1,"became, suitable to him;"]," or ",[1,"fit, meet,"]," or ",[1,"proper, for him:"]," [as though it were sought, or desired, or desirable:] but they have been content to use ",[2,"اِنْبَغَى"]," in the place of this verb. (Zj, TA in art. ",[2,"بغى"],". [",[2,"يَنْبَغِى"],", in the Kur xix. 93, is expl. by ",[2,"يَنْطَلِبُ"]," in the Ksh and in the Expos. of Bd.])"],"f":"7"},{"h":"إِطْتَلَبَ","t":["see 1, first sentence."],"f":"8"},{"h":"طِلْبٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],", in two places: ― -b2- and ",[2,"طَالِب"],"."]},{"h":"طَلَبٌ","t":["an inf. n. of 1 [q. v.]. (S, A, &c.) ― -b2- See also ",[2,"طَالِبٌ"],", in two places. ― -b3- And see ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],"."]},{"h":"طُلْبَةٌ","t":[[1,"A far-extending journey:"]," (O, K:) and so ↓ ",[2,"سَفَرٌ طَلُوبٌ"],". (A.)"]},{"h":"طِلْبَةٌ","t":["[",[1,"A mode,"]," or ",[1,"manner, of seeking"]," &c.: an inf. n. of modality, like ",[2,"جِلْسَةٌ"]," &c. ― -b2- And] a subst from ",[2,"طَالَبَهُ"],": (K:) see ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],", in three places. ― -b3- ",[2,"أُمُّ طِلْبَةَ"],[1,"The eagle."]," (O, K.)"]},{"h":"طَلِبَةٌ","t":["an inf. n. of ",[2,"طَلَبَهُ"]," [q. v.]. (MA.) ― -b2- [It generally signifies] ",[1,"A thing that one seeks, desires, demands,"]," or ",[1,"asks for; a thing that one seeks, desires,"]," or ",[1,"endeavours, to find and to get"]," or ",[1,"take; an object of quest,"]," or ",[1,"desire;"]," (S, O, Msb, K;) as also ↓ ",[2,"طِلَابٌ"],", which is originally an inf. n. of ",[2,"طَالَبَهُ"],"; (Msb;) and so ↓ ",[2,"طِلْبٌ"],"; (Har p. 560;) and ↓ ",[2,"طِلْبَةٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبٌ"]," are substs. from ",[2,"طَالَبَهُ"],", (K,) signifying [the same, or] ",[1,"a right,"]," or ",[1,"due, sought,"]," or ",[1,"demanded:"]," (TK:) and ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"]," signifies also ",[1,"an object of want,"]," or ",[1,"need; a needful thing:"]," (TA:) its pl. is ",[2,"طَلِبَاتٌ"],". (Msb.) One says, ",[2,"لِى عِنْدَهُ"]," ↓ ",[2,"طِلْبَةٌ"]," [or ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],"] ",[1,"I have an object of quest,"]," or ",[1,"desire,"]," or ",[1,"of want,"]," or ",[1,"a right,"]," or ",[1,"due, necessary to be sought,"]," or ",[1,"demanded, of him."]," (A.) And ",[2,"فُلَانٍ"]," ↓ ",[2,"هِىَ طِلْبُ"],[1,"She is the object of love of such a one;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"طِلْبَتُهُ"],": (A, K:) or the former, (O,) or each, the latter mentioned by Lh, (TA,) means ",[1,"she is the object of quest,"]," or ",[1,"desire,"]," and ",[1,"the object of love, of such a one."]," (O, TA.) -A2- And it is said on the authority of IAar that ",[2,"طلبة"]," [app., accord. to the context, ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],"] signifies ",[1,"A company,"]," or ",[1,"an assembly, of men."]," (TA.)"]},{"h":"طِلَابٌ","t":[": see the next preceding paragraph."]},{"h":"طَلُوبٌ","t":["of which the pl. is ",[2,"طُلُبٌ"],", (K, TA,) and, as is said in the Msb, [but not in my copy of it,] ",[2,"طُلْبٌ"],"; (TA;) and ↓ ",[2,"طَلَّابٌ"],", of which the pl. is ",[2,"طَلَّابُونَ"],"; and ↓ ",[2,"طَلِيبٌ"],", of which the pl. is ",[2,"طُلَبَآءُ"],"; ",[1,"Seeking, desiring,"]," or ",[1,"demanding;"]," or ",[1,"seeking, desiring,"]," or ",[1,"endeavouring, to find and to get"]," or ",[1,"take;"]," (K, TA;) ",[1,"much,"]," or ",[1,"often;"]," all are intensive in signification. (TA.) ― -b2- And ",[2,"بِئْرٌ طَلُوبٌ"]," (O, TA) [and] ↓ ",[2,"طَلِيبٌ"]," (thus in a copy of the A) ",[1,"A well of which the water is remote:"]," (A, O, TA:) pl. of the former ",[2,"أَبْآرٌ طُلُبٌ"],". (O, TA.) See also ",[2,"طُلْبَةٌ"],"."]},{"h":"طَلِيبٌ","t":[": see the next preceding paragraph, in two places."]},{"h":"طَلَّابٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"طَلُوبٌ"],"."]},{"h":"طَالِبٌ","t":[[1,"Seeking, desiring,"]," or ",[1,"demanding;"]," or ",[1,"seeking, desiring,"]," or ",[1,"endeavouring, to find and to get"]," or ",[1,"take;"]," or ",[1,"a seeker,"]," &c.: (Msb, * K, TA:) [and used for ",[2,"طَالِبُ عِلْمٍ"],[1,"a student of science"]," or ",[1,"knowledge:"],"] pl. ",[2,"طُلَّابٌ"]," and ",[2,"طَلَبَةٌ"]," (Msb, K, TA) and ",[2,"طُلَّبٌ"]," (K) and ",[2,"طَالِبُونَ"]," (Msb) and ",[2,"أَطْلَابٌ"]," [a pl. of pauc., like ",[2,"أَصْحَابٌ"],",] (A) and ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبٌ"],", (S, A, O, K,) or this last, as is said in the M, is [properly speaking] a quasi-pl. n., (TA,) or, (Mgh, TA,) as IAth says, (TA,) it is either a pl. of ",[2,"طَالِبٌ"]," or an inf. n. used as such, (Mgh, TA,) for ",[2,"أَهْلُ الطَّلَبِ"],": (TA:) fem., applied to a woman, ",[2,"طَالِبَةٌ"],"; of which the pl. is ",[2,"طَالِبَاتٌ"]," and ",[2,"طَوَالِبُ"],". (Msb.) You say, ",[2,"هُوَ طَالِبٌ لِلشَّىْءِ"],[1,"He is a seeker,"]," &c., ",[1,"of the thing."]," (TA.) And ",[2,"هٰؤُلَآءِ"],[2,"أَعْدَائِهِمْ"]," ↓ ",[2,"طَلَبُ"]," and ",[2,"أَطْلَابُهُمْ"],[1,"These are"]," the troops that are ",[1,"the seekers"]," [or ",[1,"pursuers"],"] ",[1,"of their enemies."]," (A.) And ",[2,"نِسَآءٍ"]," ↓ ",[2,"هُوَ طِلْبُ"],", (A, K,) with kesr, (K,) ",[1,"He is a seeker,"]," or ",[1,"desirer, of women:"]," (A, K:) pl. ",[2,"أَطْلَابٌ"]," and ",[2,"طِلَبَةٌ"],". (K.)"]},{"h":"مَطْلَبٌ","t":[[1,"A place,"]," (Msb, KL,) or ",[1,"time,"]," (KL,) ",[1,"of seeking:"]," (Msb, KL:) [and so ↓ ",[2,"مُطَّلَبٌ"],":] pl. ",[2,"مَطَالِبُ"],". (KL.) [And particularly applied to ",[1,"A place in which treasure is buried and sought."]," And ",[1,"A place where anything remarkable is to be sought,"]," or ",[1,"looked for, in a book."],"] ― -b2- [And hence, (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"A person from whom one seeks a thing."],"] ",[2,"لَيْسَ لِى مَطْلَبٌ سِوَاكَ"]," (assumed tropical:) [",[1,"I have none from whom to seek the accomplishment of my desires but Thee"],"] occurs in a trad. respecting prayer. (TA.) ― -b3- See also ",[2,"مَطْلُوبٌ"],". ― -b4- It is also an inf. n. of 1 [q. v.]. (A, MA, Msb.)"]},{"h":"مُطْلِبٌ","t":["applied to water, and to pasture, or herbage, ",[1,"Distant,"]," or ",[1,"remote,"]," (S, A, O,) ",[1,"so as not to be attainable but by seeking,"]," (S, O,) or ",[1,"so that it is sought:"]," (A:) or, applied to pasture, or herbage, ",[1,"distant,"]," or ",[1,"remote:"]," and, applied to water, ",[1,"distant,"]," or ",[1,"remote, from the pasture"]," or ",[1,"herbage:"]," or ",[1,"between which and the pasture,"]," or ",[1,"herbage, is twice the space termed a"],[2,"مِيل"],", (K, TA,) or ",[1,"thrice that space,"]," the ",[2,"ميل"]," being ",[1,"the space from one"],[2,"عَلَم"]," [or ",[1,"sign of the way"],"] ",[1,"to another;"]," (TA;) or ",[1,"a day,"]," or ",[1,"two days,"]," (K, TA,) i. e. ",[1,"a day's journey,"]," or ",[1,"two days' journey;"]," in the latter case being termed ",[2,"مُطْلِبُ إِبِلٍ"]," [i. e. ",[1,"distant to be sought of camels"],"]. (TA.) It is also applied to other things: a poet says, ",[2,"أَهَاجَكَ بَرْقٌ آخِرَ اللَّيْلِ مُطْلِبُ"]," [",[1,"Has distant lightning, in the latter part of the night, excited thee?"],"]. (S, O.)"]},{"h":"مَطْلُوبٌ","t":[[1,"Sought, desired,"]," or ",[1,"demanded;"]," and so ↓ ",[2,"مَطْلَبٌ"]," [but app. as an epithet in which the quality of a subst. is predominant, and used in the sense of ",[2,"طَلِبَةٌ"],"]. (KL.)"]},{"h":"مُطَّلَبٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"مَطْلَبٌ"],"."]}]},"maqayis":["الطاء واللام والباء أصل واحد يدل على ابتغاء الشيء. يقال: طلبت الشيء أطلبه طلبا. وهذا مطلبي، وهذه طلبتي. وأطلبت فلانا بما ابتغاه، أي أسعفته به. وربما قالوا: أطلبته، إذا أحوجته إلى الطلب. وأطلب الكلأ: تباعد عن الماء، حتى طلبه القوم، وهو ماء مطلب. قال ذو الرمة: [أضله راعيا كلبية صدرا ... عن مطلب قارب وراده عصب]"],"mufradat":["الطلب: الفحص عن وجود الشيء، عينا كان أو معنى. قال تعالى: أو يصبح ماؤها غورا فلن تستطيع له طلبا [الكهف/ 41] ، وقال: ضعف الطالب والمطلوب [الحج/ 73] ، وأطلبت فلانا: إذا أسعفته لما طلب، وإذا أحوجته إلى الطلب، وأطلب الكلأ: إذا تباعد حتى احتاج أن يطلب."]}